":"정해진","x":958,"y":378,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"임계값(Thl℃sh()ld)을","x":1074,"y":377,"width":320,"height":39},{"text":"초괴하면","x":1409,"y":377,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트","x":1559,"y":377,"width":171,"height":37},{"text":"에플리케","x":1746,"y":375,"width":126,"height":47}]},{"text":"이선이 재생을 시작한다. 특히 스트리밍 비디오 에플리게이션은 클라이언트 애플리케","words":[{"text":"이선이","x":551,"y":437,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"재생을","x":671,"y":437,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"시작한다.","x":790,"y":437,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"특히","x":951,"y":438,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"스트리밍","x":1035,"y":437,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"비디오","x":1188,"y":437,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"에플리게이션은","x":1304,"y":437,"width":240,"height":38},{"text":"클라이언트","x":1558,"y":437,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"애플리케","x":1745,"y":435,"width":127,"height":47}]},{"text":"이선 버퍼에서 주기적으로 비디오 프레임을 가져와서 프레임을 압축해제한 다음 사용","words":[{"text":"이선","x":551,"y":497,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼에서","x":635,"y":497,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"주기적으로","x":786,"y":497,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"비디오","x":976,"y":497,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":1091,"y":497,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"가져와서","x":1244,"y":497,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":1392,"y":498,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"압축해제한","x":1545,"y":497,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"다음","x":1730,"y":496,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"사용","x":1811,"y":497,"width":63,"height":43}]},{"text":"자의 화면에 표시한다. 따라서 비니오 스트리밍 어플리케이션은 비디오의 후반 부분에","words":[{"text":"자의","x":550,"y":557,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"화면에","x":632,"y":557,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"표시한다.","x":749,"y":557,"width":145,"height":37},{"text":"따라서","x":911,"y":557,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"비니오","x":1029,"y":558,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"스트리밍","x":1142,"y":558,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"어플리케이션은","x":1294,"y":558,"width":239,"height":37},{"text":"비디오의","x":1548,"y":557,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"후반","x":1695,"y":557,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"부분에","x":1776,"y":557,"width":95,"height":46}]},{"text":"해당하는 프레임을 수신하고 버퍼링할 때 비디오를 표시한다.","words":[{"text":"해당하는","x":549,"y":618,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"프레임을","x":700,"y":617,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"수신하고","x":851,"y":617,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"버퍼링할","x":1003,"y":618,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"때","x":1153,"y":618,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"비디오를","x":1200,"y":618,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"표시한다.","x":1348,"y":618,"width":144,"height":38}]},{"text":"HTFP 스트리1그01은 유류보 등 많은 시스템에서 실제 적용되고 있으나, 중요한 문","words":[{"text":"HTFP","x":615,"y":682,"width":99,"height":29},{"text":"스트리1그01은","x":731,"y":678,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"유류보","x":920,"y":679,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"등","x":1038,"y":680,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":1089,"y":679,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"시스템에서","x":1174,"y":679,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"실제","x":1363,"y":679,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"적용되고","x":1447,"y":680,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"있으나,","x":1601,"y":679,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"중요한","x":1727,"y":679,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"문","x":1843,"y":686,"width":31,"height":38}]},{"text":"제점을 가지고 있다. 그것은 모든 클라이언트들이 그들 사이의 기용 대역폭의 차이에","words":[{"text":"제점을","x":549,"y":738,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"가지고","x":668,"y":738,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":788,"y":738,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"그것은","x":881,"y":739,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":999,"y":741,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"클라이언트들이","x":1082,"y":739,"width":237,"height":38},{"text":"그들","x":1339,"y":742,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"사이의","x":1422,"y":740,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"기용","x":1542,"y":741,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"대역폭의","x":1626,"y":739,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"차이에","x":1777,"y":739,"width":94,"height":47}]},{"text":"도 불구하고 똑같이 인코팅된 비디오를 전송받는다는 것이다. 가용 대역폭의 차이는","words":[{"text":"도","x":546,"y":802,"width":35,"height":27},{"text":"불구하고","x":597,"y":799,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"똑같이","x":753,"y":799,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"인코팅된","x":877,"y":799,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"비디오를","x":1031,"y":799,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"전송받는다는","x":1184,"y":800,"width":207,"height":38},{"text":"것이다.","x":1409,"y":801,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"가용","x":1538,"y":801,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"대역폭의","x":1624,"y":800,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"차이는","x":1777,"y":800,"width":97,"height":45}]},{"text":"서로 다른 클라이언트들 간에 존재할 뿐만 아니라 동일한 클라이언트에서도 시간에 따","words":[{"text":"서로","x":548,"y":859,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":629,"y":860,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트들","x":710,"y":860,"width":208,"height":38},{"text":"간에","x":930,"y":860,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"존재할","x":1011,"y":860,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"뿐만","x":1127,"y":861,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"아니라","x":1209,"y":861,"width":104,"height":38},{"text":"동일한","x":1325,"y":862,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"클라이언트에서도","x":1441,"y":862,"width":276,"height":39},{"text":"시간에","x":1732,"y":861,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"따","x":1844,"y":869,"width":30,"height":37}]},{"text":"른 차이가 발생한다. 이 문제점으로 인해 새로운 형태의 HTTP 기반 스트리밍인","words":[{"text":"른","x":545,"y":922,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"차이가","x":600,"y":921,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"발생한다.","x":727,"y":921,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":899,"y":921,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"문제점으로","x":951,"y":920,"width":178,"height":37},{"text":"인해","x":1151,"y":921,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"새로운","x":1239,"y":921,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"형태의","x":1366,"y":923,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"HTTP","x":1491,"y":928,"width":101,"height":28},{"text":"기반","x":1615,"y":923,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"스트리밍인","x":1702,"y":922,"width":170,"height":45}]},{"text":"DASH (Dynamic Adaptive Streaming over HTTP)가 개발되었다. DASH에서 비","words":[{"text":"DASH","x":545,"y":986,"